<h2>Final Verdict — Is Acrylic Finish Right for Your Home?</h2>
<p>After covering every dimension of acrylic finish — types, applications, problems, costs, competitors, and maintenance — here is the honest summary decision framework.</p>
<div class="callout"><span class="callout__title">Choose Acrylic When…</span><div class="callout"><span class="callout__title">Note</span>Acrylic is the right choice when these conditions apply to your project:</p>
<div class="callout"><span class="callout__title">Note</span><div class="callout"><span class="callout__title">Note</span><h4>✅ Acrylic Is Your Answer</h4>
<ul>
  <li>You want factory-consistent colour across a large panel installation</li>
  <li>Your design calls for a premium, glass-like depth of colour</li>
  <li>Flat-panel (not profiled/curved) door designs throughout</li>
  <li>You are open to matte finish as the default for high-contact surfaces</li>
  <li>Budget supports ₹1,400–₹2,800/sqft installed for shutters</li>
  <li>You want 15–20 year material durability from a quality sheet</li>
